          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Résumé: Observation de la chute rapide d'un point lumineux.",
          "text_sha256": "1e8f560b6f5093913d62c54dbffcb42de2acb7cc65051b073d3f29233b0c7901"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
